Account filters treat punctuation inside patterns literally instead of as regular expressions.

========== API ==========

aggregate({ accounts: ['Assets.Cash', 'Assets:^Cash$'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  format 1,000.00 SEK
  default
account Assets:Cash
account Assets:^Cash$
account Equity:Opening
2024-01-01 Opening
  Assets:Cash  1 SEK
  Assets:^Cash$  2 SEK
  Equity:Opening

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "account": "Assets:^Cash$",
    "commodity": "SEK",
    "quantity": "2"
  }
]

========== WARNINGS ==========
